<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Matengo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Aepesu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua jaka Pauli kwa Aefesu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Aepesu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Aepe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua jaka Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Aepesu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Balua kwa Aepesu jaandikwa kipindi simu na balua ja Akolosai saka sa sitini baada ju kusaliwa Yesu. Balua jundongale mweni ngati ntumi Pauli. Linga mu la lipungu 1:1. Asomi bingi ajetake Pauli jwaandaki Aepesu hata ngati jikosa aina ju umundu ukulamuki gogumanyakini kwa Akolosai. Kwa ndaba heji kwaa kwapalika juyongoluta mumakundi ga bandu ba bunhobale Kilisitu mu nkoa. Pauli kabee juandika jwabi mu kipungu pajwaandika balua jenze. Linga mu lipungu la 3:1, 4:1, na 6:20. Pauli antuma Tukiko kupeleka balua heji pajwabii mu sapwali kujenda ku likundi la bandu ba bunhobale Kilisitu baabi ku Epesu. Linga mu lipungu la 6:21-22.</para>
  <para style="ip">Epesu gwabiya Musi nkolongu ngamaa na kabee wabi musi ukulombase nu kulomba hindu wa Alomani buku nkoa uku Asia. Epesu wamanyikana ngamaa mu nyumba jaka ji kisapanga jeajisengiki homu na jebijipia kwaka kisapanga siki mbomba juku Giliki sebikikema Atemi. Linga mu lipungu la Mahengu 19:23-31, Bandu Kilisitu buku Epesu palatumbuliya labii na makili ngamaa lakini mwenikatai lahoa makili gaki. Linga mu Uyekuli lipungu la 2:1-7.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pauli julongi mu kipindi sa nusu ju utumbuli wa balua jenze namuna Sapanga hejwaaengi bandu baki na kwaagombo kuhuma mu mahakau kupete Yesu Kilisitu. Julenganesa likundi la bandu ba bunhobali Kilisitu ndi nhyega na Kilisitu, ndi kimutu ni kipandi sa pili si kitabu saka Pauli jupiiki maelesu namuna ju kutama mu maisha ga bandu ba bunhobali Kilisitu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabii nkati</para>
  <para style="io">Mu sapwali jaka 1:1 Pauli julongulike mweni kwaalamuki Aepesu.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabee julandi likundi la bandu ba bunhobali Kilisitu namuna jukutama pamu ni Kilisitu. Linga 1:3-3:21</para>
  <para style="io">Kabee Pauli julandi namuna heapalika bandu ba bunhobali Kilisitu kutama. Linga mu lipungu 4:1-6:20</para>
  <para style="io">Mwisuweni Pauli jupia malobi gu kupunga. Linga 6:21-24.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Nepani Pauli, ntumi waka Kilisitu Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Ku upali waka Sapanga nunhandaki mwanganya mwabandu baka Sapanga ku Epesu, monhobaleka mu kujongana ni Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Tunndobee waamboni waka Sapanga nu lukwali kuhuma kwaka Sapanga Atati bitu na kwaka Bambu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbenge i kiloho mu kujongana ni Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Julumbalika Sapanga wa Atati baka Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu! Ndaba mu kujongana ni Kilisitu jutupeki mbenge yoti i kiloho kuhuma kundema ji kiloho. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Kabula jukubombwa nndema, Sapanga jutuhagula twepani tubiya twa bandu baki sukujongana ni Kilisitu ili tubiya sapi na bandu banga na makosa palongi jaki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Ndaba ju upali waki, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Sapanga japala toka mwandi kutuhagu twepani tubiya ngati twabana baki kwi indela jaka Yesu Kilisitu. Hela ndi ekunndengannya na ejapala. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Ndienu, tundumbaliya Sapanga ndaba ja uamboni waki nkolongu gojutupeki kupete Mwana waki joampai! <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Ndaba kwa mwai waka Kilisitu twepani tukomboliwi yaani mahakau gitu gatei kuboka. Ndi egubii ukolongu wa uamboni waki, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />gojutupeki ku kipemu kikolongu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Kwa malangu nu umanyi waki woti, <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Sapanga jahengiki sejapala, jutumanyisi mpangu waki wa sili, go japala kuguhenga kwi indela jaka Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Mpangu we hogu gwabiya jakahenga mu kipindi sejupangiki mweni Sapanga, Kilisitu jaibeka hindu yoti yukunani kwaka Sapanga na yupundema pamu, ilonguswa na jombi.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Mukujongana ni Kilisitu, twepani butupeki wokopu ngati ebutupangi ngati ejapala Sapanga toka mwandi. Sapanga juhenga majambu goti ngati ejuamu na ejupala mweni. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Ndienu, twepani totulonguli kunhobale Kilisitu tupalika kuulumbalii ukolongu waka Sapanga!<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Namwanganya kabee bandu banga Ayaudi, mugajoani malobi ga sakaka ndi Lijambu la Amboni laka Sapanga lelundete wokovu, munhobali Kilisitu na Sapanga, ili kulangi mwanganya ndi mwabandu baki, Sapanga jummbeki mwanganya alama ja Loho wa Sapi panani jinu ili kulangi mwanganya mwa bandu baki ngati ejutulagila. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Loho hoju ndi poni jukupata majambu goti gajaalagi Sapanga bandu baki, ni lijambu heli lutulangi sakaka nde Sapanga jaakombula bandu baki boti baabii baki. Tugulumbaliya ukolongu waki!<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuloba kwaka Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Kwa ndaba heji, tumbuka panajoa emunhobale Bambu Yesu na upali winu kwa bandu ba Sapi palongi jaka Sapanga, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />ngasengotwiki hata kasokopi kunsengu Sapanga kwa ndaba jinu. Nunkomboka kila panunndoba Sapanga, <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />ili Sapanga waka Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu, Atati baabii akolongu, jumpekiya loho hoju jojampekiya mwanganya malangu nu uwesu ukummanya Sapanga sapi ngani. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Nundoba Sapanga juyekula mioju jii ili nhwesa kugubona unang'anu waki, ili kumanya senhobale sela sejummbeki nu ulumbi nkolongu wa nhupi yejaabeki bandu baki, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />na mpata kumanya uwesu waki egubii nkolongu kwitu twepani totunhobale. Uwesu we hogu goguhenga lihengu nkati jitu twepani totuhobale ndi gulengana na makili makolongu gala, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />makili ga gunhyoa Kilisitu kuhuma kwa bandu baawii, guntamiki upandi waki wa malele ukunani kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Hoku, Kilisitu ndi kilongosi nkolongu kupeta aka kilongosi boti bu kunani na bunu uwesu na aka bambu na aka akolongu, kabee liina laki likolongu kupeta mahina gaka akolongu boti bupunndema pani wala nndema gogwihika. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Sapanga jubei hindu yoti pai ja magolu gaki na ambeka jubia nkolongu wa kila sindu mu likundi la bandu ba bunhobale Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Bandu ba bunhobale Kilisitu ndi Yega jaka Kilisitu, nu utimilifu waki Kilisitu jojutimisa hindu yoti kila pandu.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuhuma mu kuwa mbaki kujingii mu womi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Mwanganya mwabiya nkuwiki ndaba ja makosa na mahakau ginu. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Kipindi sela mkubika ntama kukupwata majambu giliya ngati eahenga bandu bupundema pani, mwabiya munzetake nkolongu ji ilombu yana makili jojubii kunani kunhwai, ilombu yeyuye sajenu ilongo bandu banga kunzetake Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Na hata twepani twaboti twabii ngati bombi, twatama kulengana na ndokule itu yu pundema nukuhenga pe majambu agalaga gagalengane nhyega na malangu gitu. Na twepani kabee twabii ngati bombi, twapalika azabu jaka Sapanga.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Lakini Sapanga ndi jwana ikia ingi. Jutupala ku upali nkolongu, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />hata ana twabiya tukuwiki mu loho ndaba ja mahakau, jutuhengiki tutama pamu ni Kilisitu Yesu. Kwa uamboni waka Sapanga mwanganya muokwi. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Su kujongana ni Kilisitu Yesu, Sapanga jutuyoa pamu, tukalongua pamu najombi kunani kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Jahenga hela ili kulangi uamboni waki nkolongu wanga kuba ni kipemu kwa bandu boti, babihika ipindi ya masoba ya mwenikatai kwi indela ju upali waki, su kujongana na Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Ndaba, kwa uamboni waka Sapanga nkombuliwi kwi indela ju kuhobaleka. Lijambu le heli ngaselihikiki ndaba ju kuhenga lihengu ngani ila je nhupi pena kuhuma kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Ndaba ngaseihengiki kwa mahengu ginu henu jiikuba mundu ju kukipuna. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Twepani ndi iumbi yaka Sapanga, na ku kujongana ni Kilisitu Yesu, Sapanga jutubomba ili tutama nu kuhenga gaamboni gajutuandali tugahenga.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuba sindu simu na Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Mwanganya nkombuka emwabii mwandi mwabandu banga Ayaudi sukubelekwa na nkemwa na Ayaudi, “Bandu banga kusekuliwa jandu,” Ayaudi bilikema, “Asekwi jandu,” ndaba ja sela sebikihengiki beni nhyega yabu kwa maboku. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Kipindi se sela mwanganya mwabii ngasemumanyi Kilisitu, mwabii kunza ja bandu buku Izilaeli, mwabii mwaageni ndaba mwabii kunza ja malaganu gajalagila Sapanga bandu baki. Mwatama pani punndema bila kuhobale na bila kummanya Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Lakini henu su kujongana ni Kilisitu Yesu, mwanganya bamwabii kutali na Sapanga, bunzopiki kwi indela ja mwai waka Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Ndaba Kilisitu mweni jutuletii lukwali sukuhenga Ayaudi na bandu banndema yoti kuba sindu simu. Kupete indela jukujipia yega jaki mweni ngati litambiku, jugupia ubaja gogwabaganisa ngati ukuta pikilanda jabu. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Jaboa Malagalaki pamu ni mihilu jaki nu kuyobale kwaki, ili kupete kubaganika kwa Ayaudi na banga Ayaudi, jaahenga kuba sindu simu nu ku kuhenga hela jaleta lukwali. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Kwi indela jukupia nhyega jaki, Kilisitu juguboa ubaja wabu, ku nsalaba waki jaalombanisa na bandu be haba kuba bamwa nu kujonganisa na Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Ndienu, Kilisitu jahika kulandi Lijambu la Amboni laka Sapanga lu lukwali kwinu mwanganya mwabandu banga Ayaudi momwabii kutali na Sapanga, na kabee kwa Ayaudi babube babii pambipi na Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Henu, kwi indela jaki, twepani twaboa, Ayaudi na bandu banga Ayaudi, tuwesa kwaajendee Atati kwa kwi indela jaka Loho jumu.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Ndienu, mwabandu banga Ayaudi nga mwaagene kabee, wala nga mwabandu baapeta. Henu mwanganya ndi mwaakola ndema pamu na bandu baka Sapanga, mwanganya mwabandu bikikaja saka Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Bunsengiki panani ju nsingi gobugubei mitumi na Alota baka Sapanga najombi Yesu Kilisitu mweni ndi lilibu lunsingi heli lelikamulaki nyumba. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Jombi ndi jojilombanisi linyumba loti nu kulihenga libiya likolongu mbaka kuba Nyumba ja Sapi jaka Sapanga ndaba jaka Bambu. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Mukujongana ni Kilisitu, mwanganya kabee na boti bangi, nsegwa mu nyumba jaka Sapanga kwi indela jaka Loho waki.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Lihengu laka Pauli kwa bandu banga Ayaudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Kulengana na haga, nepani Pauli, mpungwa waka Kilisitu Yesu ndaba jinu mwanganya, nunndobe Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Ku sakaka nzoini lihengu lela la waamboni Sapanga, lenapata ndaba jinu, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Sapanga juyekuli nu kumanyisa sili jenze jejihihiki. Nanepani nunhandaki lijambu le heli su ujipi, <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />nanamu anansomiki malobi gangu mwiwesa kumanya enihelewa sili jaka Kilisitu heji. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Pamwandi bandu ngase baamanyisi sili je heji; lakini henu Sapanga jaamanyisi mitumi na alota baka Sapanga na bandu ba Sapi kwi indela ja Loho. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Sili jeni ndi jenze: Kwi indela ji Lijambu la Amboni Sapanga jaapeke mbengalelu bandu banga Ayaudi yeilengana na Ayaudi. Bandu be haba ndi ihungu ya nhyega jimu, nabombi ajopa pandu pa hindu yejaalagi Sapanga kupete Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Nepani anhengiki kuba nu ntumisi wa Lijambu la Amboni kwa uamboni wakajika gojumbeki Sapanga kwi indela ju uwesu waki nkolongu. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Nepani namundu nu nsoku kupeta bandu boti baka Sapanga. Lakini jumbeki nepani uamboni waka Kilisitu wakaalandi bandu banga Ayaudi Lijambu la Amboni langa ni kipemu, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />nahaguliwa ili nundangiya bandu boti ili awesa kumanya sili jaka Sapanga hejihenga lihengu. Sapanga jambombiki hindu yoti jahiya sili jeheji kwa ibeleku yoka tumbuka mwandi. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Henu ndaba, kwi indela ja bandu ba bunhobali Kilisitu, aka kilongosi na baabi na makili bu kunani kwaka Sapanga amanya malangu gaka Sapanga mu majambu gingi. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Sapanga jahenga heli kwi indela jaka Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu ngati ejapala yaka petapeta. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Ndienu, sukujongana ni Kilisitu nu kukunhobale jombi, twepani tunzendee Sapanga sukuhobale bila kujogopa. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Henu, nundoba mwihola ndaba ja mang'aliku gambata ndaba jinu, ndaba henga haga kwinu ndaba ju ulumbi winu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upali waka Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Kwa ndaba heji, naagungamali Atati, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />baabii utumbuli wa kaja yoti yu pundema nu kunani kwaka Sapanga, <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Nundoba Sapanga, jojubii nu ulumbi nkolongu, jungangamalisa mwanganya mioju jinu kwa makili ga gaki, kwi indela ja loho waki, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />najombi Kilisitu jutama mioju jinu su kuhobale. Noba ili mmbiya mikega nukujema nganganganga mu misingi ju upali, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />ili nhwesa kumanya pamu na bandu boti baka Sapanga kulengana nu upali waka Kilisitu egubii nndasu na egupanwiki na egukoliki na egunyoliki. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Heloo, mpata kumanya upali waka Kilisitu gogupeta umanyi gwoti, ili nhwesa kutwelakewa ngani nu kuhiki kipemu saka Sapanga sekitweli.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Julumbalika Sapanga jojuwesa kuhenga mahengu makolongu kupeta gatugaloba na gatugawasali. Kwi indela ja makili gaki gagahenga lihengu nkati jito, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />julumbalika Sapanga kupete bandu ba bunhobali Kilisitu na kupete Kilisitu Yesu ipindi yoti, yaka petapeta na petapeta, Amina.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Kujongana mu nhyega jaka Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Ndienu nepani ne angongiki ndaba nuntumaki Bambu, nundoba ntama ngati ejupala Sapanga kulengana ni lihengu lejunkemi Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Mmbiya muda woti mo nngungamali, apoli na banhinakali su upali. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Nkasana kutunza ujonganu winu goguletwa na Loho kupete indela ju lukwali jejundombanesa. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Jibii nhyega jimu na loho jimu na kuhobale kumu kojunkemi Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Jubii Bambu jumu, kuhobale kumu nu ubatisu gumu, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Jubii Sapanga jumu baabi Atati ba boti, jojuwe jubii panani ja boti, juhenga lihengu kwa bandu boti na jubii kwa bandu boti.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Kila jumu witu jupatiki uamboni kulengana ni kipemu sa nhupi seampeki Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Ngati egapwaga Maandiku gaka Sapanga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Pajajenda kunani kwaka Sapanga ngani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">jaajukua bandu bajaakamwi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">jaapekiya bandu nhupi.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Henu pajupwaga, “Jagoluka kunani kwaka Sanga,” kubii na mana bole? Maana jaki ndi ana, jatumbuliya kuhuluka hoti pai ngani punndema. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Ndienu, hoju jojahuluka pani punndema ndi jojagoluka kunani ngani kupeta kunani kwaka Sapanga ili jugutwelakiya nndema woti. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Ndi jojapekiya bandu nhupi: Bangi jaapekiya abiya mitumi, bangi alota baka Sapanga, bangi aenisa Lijambu la Amboni, bangi babaalongosa bandu baka Sapanga na aka abola. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Jahenga hela ili juwesa kwaahandaa bandu boti baka Sapanga kwa ndaba ji lihengu laka Kilisitu ili kujisenga nhyega jaki, <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />twepani twaboa tuwesa kuba sindu simu mu kuhobale nu kummanya Mwana waka Sapanga, tubiya twabandu baakoi mukuhobale nu kuhiki kutimii kwaka Kilisitu mweni. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Ndienu ngatukubi kabee ngati bana asoku, babutuleke nu kutupongalo koni na koni kwa kila namuna ju unhwai wa mabole gaapia bandu bini isoli ili baahoa bandu kwi isoli. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Ana tulonge usakaka kwa mwoju wo upali twiendaliya kukola mu majambu goti mbaki kulengana ni Kilisitu jojuwe ndi kimutu, <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Pai ju ulongosi waki, ihungu yoti ya nhyega ikamulana pamu na nhyega kwi mitanda, na nhyega joti jihobaleka ku kujangatiwa ni ihungu yaki. Ndienu kila kiungu ana kihenga lihengu laki sapi, nhyega joti jikola nu kujisenga mu upali.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maisha manyai mu Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Ndienu, nunhingamaki ana: Mwiiendale kabee kutama ngati bandu banga kummanya Sapanga, baapwata mawasu gabu giliya, <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />na malangu gabu gabii kulwii. Abii kutali na womi waka Sapanga kwa ndaba ju ung'ang'a gogubi nkati jabu ni ing'omu yabu. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Ahobiki na ngaseabii ni iyoni, aamwi kujingi mu majambu giliya, nukupala kuhenga majambu gi iyoni sanga kukotoka na atokule kuba na mali gingi ngani.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Lakini mwanganya gasemummyi Kilisitu kwandela heji. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Kulangi hotuhotu mwajoa sapi majambu gaka Kilisitu, na mwabii mwa abole baki na mwabolwa najombi usakaka gogubii nkati jaka Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Ndienu, nkotuka majambu giliya gamwabiya nhenga mwandi, gagabiya gumpeleka ku kuwa, sukupwata ndokule yaki yeyabiya itenda kunkonga. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Mioju jinu na malangu ginu gapalika kulenganake su unyai. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Nhwata umundu unyai goguwe gubombiki kwa malenganu gaka Sapanga na goguwe gulilangi mu maisha gu usakaka nu gukujetakewa na Sapanga nukuba nu usapi.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Henu nkotuka isoli. Kila jumu jupalika kumpwagi nnzaku usakaka, maana kila jumu witu ndi kiungu sa nhyega jaka Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Ana nhyomiki, mwijetake inyela inu yunhenga nhenga mahakau, na wala mwiitama ni inyela pipipipi. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Mwalipeke lijobi mbekenyu. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Jojabii mwii jwiijiba kabee, ila jutumbuliya kuhenga lihengu la amboni kwa maboku gaki, juwesa kuba na sindu su kunzangati mundu jojubii nhagu. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Malobi ganga na mana giipita hata kidogu mu milomu ji; masoba goa malobi ginu gabiya ga sapi gaguge gagangamalisa mioju na kwaajangati bangi, ili gaasenga bandu binu baajoane. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Mwampeke usungu Loho jaka Sapanga, ndaba Loho we hoju jubii ngati poni jaka Sapanga kwinu mwanganya mwa bandu baki, najombi julangi lisoba limu liitenda kuhika lelule Sapanga jwaakombula bandu baki. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Ndienu nkotuka usungu ni inyela ngolongu na mwiiyoma na mwiikuba na keleli na matondu na nkotuka kila uliya! <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Mmbiya na mwoju wamboni na gogubii gukuboniana ikia, kila jumu andekakiya nnzaki makosa ngati najombi Sapanga ejunndekakiya mwanganya mahakau ginu kwi indela jaka Kilisitu.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Kutama mu unang'anu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Henu mu nnziga Sapanga ndaba mwanganya ndi mwabana baki mojumpai. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Upali gulongosa maisha ginu ngati Kilisitu ejutupai, na ndaba jitu julipia mweni ngati litambiku lelibii nu ulumba wa sapi ni litambiku lelunndengane Sapanga.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Henu ndaba mwanganya mwa bandu baka Sapanga, ndienu uselati nu usapu wokapi gola au soju wilongaleka kabee kati jinu ngati ekupalika kwa bandu baka Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Kabee malobi gi iyoni na giking'ang'a au malobi galiya goti haga mwanganya mwilonge, malobi gu kunsengu Sapanga ndi gagapalika. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Mmanya hotuhotu, nselati jokapi au jojuhenga majambu giiyoni au nsoju bandu ngati haba alengana na bandu baagungamali imong'umong'u, au mundu jokapi ngati haba ngajijingi mu ukolongu waka Kilisitu na waka Sapanga.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Mwijetake kukongwa na mundu kwa malobi ganga na mana; ndaba kwa majambu ngati haga inyela yaka Sapanga yahikila bandu ngati haba banga kunzoane. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Ndienu, mwiijongana na bandu bahenga majambu ngati haga. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Pamwandi mwanganya mwabii palwii, lakini henu mwanganya mmbii mu unang'anu su kujongana na Bambu. Ntamannya ngati bana bu unang'anu, <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />ndaba gagapiti kupete kutama mu unang'anu ndi uamboni, kujetakewa na Sapanga nu kulonge sakaka. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Nndenga kugamanya gala gagunndengani Bambu. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Mwiijongana kuhenga mahengu gangakupalika gagabii ga lwii, ila mwagalangia goti pagwendu. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Ndaba majambu gagahengwa kwa sili galeta iyoni ngasegapalika hata kugapwaga. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Lakini kila sindu anakiyekuliwi nu unang'anu, usakaka waki gutenda kubonikana, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />na kila sekibonikana ndi unang'anu. Ndi mana Maandiku gapwaga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Jumuka wehapa wegugoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">yooka kuhuma kwa bandu baawii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">najombi Kilisitu jang'alasiya ili guwesa kuelewa.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Ndienu, mulilingaliya entama. Mwiitama ngati ang'ang'a, ila ngati bana malangu. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Nkasana kutumi kila mbekenyu sapi ngati ekuwesikana ndaba masoba ge haga giliya. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Henu, mwiikuba mwaang'ang'a, ila nndenga kumanya gajupala Bambu. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Mwiilobe uwembi ndaba gwanhenga ntenda majambu giliya, ila ntwelaliya Loho jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Nndongalannya kwa malobi ga Zabuli, miyambu yukulumbali na miambu ji kiloho; munzembila Bambu miyambu na Zabuli sukusengu mu mioju jinu. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Munsengula Sapanga Atati masoba goti ndaba ja majambu goti, kwi liina laka Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabole ga bandu bajukuini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Kila jumu antunzila nnzaki isima ndaba jukuntendee isima Kilisitu.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Mwakambomba mwaatendila isima akanalomi bii ngati emunzoane Bambu. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Ndaba mwanalomi andongoo nhwanamundu, ngati Kilisitu ejalongoo bandu ba bunhobale, najombi Kilisitu mweni ndi jojaakombula bandu ba bunhobali Kilisitu bandu haba ndi nhyega jaki. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Ngati bandu ba bunhobali Kilisitu hebunzoane Kilisitu, ndi ahelahela, aka mbomba bajoannya akalomi babu mu majambu goti.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Nanamu mwakanalomi, mwaapala aka mbomba binu ngati Kilisitu ejaapala bandu ba bunhobale jombi, sukupia womi waki kwa ndaba jabu. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Jahenga hela ili kulinyambisa likundi la bandu ba bunhobale Kilisitu palongi jaka Sapanga baada jakaasapisa kwi lilobi laki ngati mundu ejusapisa kwa masi, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />ili julipatila likundi la bandu ba bunhobale jombi la sapi ngani, bandu ba bunhobale jombi banga ni kihakau, na kasolu au sokapi sekilengana na hesi ila abia bandu baasapi banga ni lidoa. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Ahelahe, akanalomi apalika kwaapala aka mbomba babu ngati hebiipala nhyega yabu beni. Joampala nhwanamundu jilipala mweni. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Ngamundu jokapi jojijisuki nhyega jaki; ila jujilea nukujitunza. Ndi ahelahe Kilisitu hejaatunza bandu ba bunhobali jombi, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />maana twepani ndi iungu ya nhyega jaki. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Ngati maandiku gaka Sapanga egapwaga “Kwa ndaba heji, mwanalomi jaaleka atati baki na amabu baki, jijongana nu nhanu waki, nabombi abeli haba biibiya nhyega jimu.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Gubii usakaka goguhihiki mu malobi haga, nanepani mona gunhusu Kilisitu ni likundi labandu ba bunhobale jombi. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Lakini gunhusu kabee mwanganya: Kila mwanalomi ampala nhwanu waki ngati ejulipala mweni, najombi mmbomba antendila isima nndomi waki.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Bana na Atati na Anyongo babu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Mwabana mwenga, mwajoannya atati binu na amabu binu mu Bambu ndaba heli ndi lijambu laamboni. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />Ngati Maandiku gaka Sapanga egapwaga, “Mwaatendila isima atati na amabu binu,” goniogu ndi nhilu gogubii guutumbuli mu lilagi, <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />“Ili gupata mbengalelu nu kutama yaka hingi punndema.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Nanamu mwaka tati mwaasukisa bana binu ila mwaajangatiya akola kwi isima na mabole gi Kikilisitu.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baahenga lihengu na aka bambu babu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Mwa atumwa, mwajoannya aka bambu binu bupu ndema pani ku kiholu nu kubagaja, nhenga hela ku usapi wa mwoju ngati emuntumaki Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Nhenga hela nga pa akuba aka bambu bii pena ili mmbonikana baamboni kwabu, ila nhenga su upali waka Sapanga ndaba mwanganya mwaatumisi baka Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Nhenga lihengu linu sukutogule ngati muntumaki Bambu na nga ngati mwaatumaki bandu. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Nkombuka ana kila mundu jojihenga ga amboni jubiya ntumisi au mundu jojulekakiwi, jiijopa seketule jaki kuhuma kwaka Bambu.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Nanamu mwaka bambu bupundema pani, mwaatendila ahelahela atumisi binu, na nkotuka kwaajogo. Nkombuka ndee mwanganya mmbii ngati bombi mmbii na Bambu ajolajola kunani kwaka Sapanga, najombi ngasejahenge bandu suku bagu.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngondu ji kiloho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Mwisu weni, nundoba mbiya nganganganga mukujongana na Bambu na kukujangatiwa na makili gaki makolongu. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Nhwata hindu yukukomane ngondu yejumpeke Sapanga mpata kuipenga mipangu jiliya jaka Lijobi. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Ndaba ngondu jitu nga kati jitu na bandu, ila tukomana na makili gi ilombu mu nndema wi kiloho, tukomana na baalongosa, akolongu na bana makili, baalongosa nndema gongo wa lwii. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Kwa ndaba heji, nhwata hindu yu kukomane ngondu yejumpeki Sapanga ili lisoba lela elihika nhwesa kugapenga makili ga bandu abaja, na nkomini mbaka mwisu, mwibiya mwakona nganganganga.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Ndienu, ntama mihu. Usakaka gubiya ngati nkanda mukibunu sinu, kujetakewa na Sapanga kubiya ngati lingobu la somasoma lukuenga pikigamba, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />na kuba tayali kulandi Lijambu la Amboni lu lukwali jibiya ngati ilatu mwa magolu ginu. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Kupeta haga goti, kuhobale kubiya muda woti ngati ngau mu maboku ginu, junhwesisa kujisusu mikoa ja mwotu jaka Mbaja jola. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Nnzopa wokovu ngati kopia jinu ja somasoma ni Lilobi laka Sapanga ngati upanga yejumpeki Loho jaka Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Nndoba kila lisoba, koni mwakaloba kujangatiwa na Sapanga. Nndoba sukulongoswa na Loho wa Sapi. Nkelukiya bila kusoka koni mwakaalobila bandu boti baka Sapanga. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Nnobila nanepani kabee ili Sapanga jumbekiya malobi gukulonge, nhwesa kwaamanyisa bandu sili ji Lijambu la Amboni sanga kujogopa. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Nepani ndi nu ntumi wi Lijambu la Amboni hata ngati henu mii mukipungu. Henu nndoba, ili nhwesa kuba nganganganga mukulandi ngati ekupalika.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malamuki ga mwisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tukiko, nndongu witu jotumpai nu ntumisi jojunhobaleka mu kujongana na Bambu, jampekiya majambu gangu goti ili mmanya gagambatiki na enhenga lihengu. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Nuntuma kwinu jumpekiya majambu gitu ili jumpolisa mwoju.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Nunndobe mwa alongu bangu lukwali nu upali nu kuhobale kuhuma kwaka Sapanga Atati nu kuhuma kwaka Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Nunndobe uamboni waka Sapanga boti babumpai Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu ku upali wanga na mwisu.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>